  dialogueBubbles:
  - snippets:
    - My name was Hori.
    - I was born in Heliopolis.
  - snippets:
    - I worked as a scribe for a local administrator.
    - I could read, write, and calculate very well.
  - snippets:
    - I kept copies of everything I wrote.
    - I never completely trusted other people's memories.
  - snippets:
    - I once discovered a tax collector stealing grain because the records did not match.
    - I preferred to observe carefully before accusing someone.
